14. Decision log\
Date\
Id\
Decision\
2026-07-17\
D-001\
Qt 6 Widgets. Not QML, not web. Existing toolchain, and Widgets is the correct tool for tree-structured data editors\
2026-07-17\
D-002\
Policy is path-keyed, never leaf-name-keyed. Evidence: iic_devices[*].size and pci_devices[*].bars[*].size are the same leaf with opposite policy\
2026-07-17\
D-003\
Hand-rolled ordered JSON reader/writer. QJsonObject sorts keys lexicographically and would reorder every object in the manifest\
2026-07-17\
D-004\
P-2 preserve-unknown. The schema is not final; the tool must not become the thing that blocks it evolving\
2026-07-17\
D-005\
The read-vs-echo test governs tier assignment. A field is editable iff changing it changes what the emulator does. Echo fields made editable are worse than readonly: the user types, nothing happens, the manifest lies\
